{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "133",
 "name": "Adder's Coil",
 "file": "Map133_Adders_Coil.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":3,"x":0,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["Thin veils of black widow's lace grass drape over the soft soil, silencing every step as if it were enfolded in its own void.  The foliage seems to stir constantly when glimpsed peripherally, yet no movement can be discerned in the immediate surroundings."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":4,"x":-20,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A severely knotted witchclaw tree rises in the center of the path, its barren branches entangled in pale silver amethyst vines blooming with vibrant violet blossoms.  The scene is a stark contrast of despair and beauty, one that is prevalent in this mysterious forest."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":5,"x":-40,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["Soft patches of black lichen show up sparsely on the soil, intertwined with widow's lace and dark green moss.  Trees of all shapes, sizes and colors writhe up from the soil in all directions.  Woven amidst the branches of every tree are dark green vines tinged with a crimson gleam, a curious sign of foreboding to the experienced tracker."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":-20,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["Tangled masses of dark green vines dangle down from their perches, interwoven into the treetop canopy far above the forest floor.  The rustling of leaves is audible in the distance, yet the presence of wildlife seems strangely absent."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":0,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A teetering wild plum tree flanks the path, burdened by a shawl of the omnipresent green vines tinged with red highlights.  The thorns of each vine dig and pierce into the wounded tree's fleshy bark, as if feasting upon fallen prey."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":-20,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["The pungent aroma of jasmine perfumes the air, although no blossoms are visible.  Silvery strands of a tangled widow's web stretch between the branches of a stunted witchclaw tree, adorning it like a fine-jeweled platinum glove."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":9,"x":0,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A single tree lies toppled in the pathway, covered with a carpet of red-thorned dark green vines.  With sporadic movements, the vines twitch and twist over the withering ironwood husk, as if sapping it of its very life."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":10,"x":20,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["Giant ferns sweep out into the pathway here, brushing passersby with their feathery fronds.  The distant sounds of trickling water cascades through the air, beckoning from the depths of the mysterious wood."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":11,"x":0,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A massive black willow looms the height of twenty Gor'Togs or more, casting a pall of shade over the silent forest floor.  The sheer number and variety of shrubs, trees, and vines basking beneath it is startling, as if this lush forest was host to every variety of plant known to mortals -- and surely some that have yet to be discovered."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":12,"x":-20,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A pool of gleaming silvery water yawns open in the earth, its surface glassy and serene.  Blooming amethyst vines emerge from its depths to coil up the side of a nearby yew tree.  The darker crimson-tinted vines seem to shy away from the pool, rejecting the nourishment it supplies."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":13,"x":-40,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A curtain of undulating maiden's tresses is visible high in the treetops above, twitching about in search of warm flesh to devour in its deadly embrace.  All is quiet save for the rustling of the tress vines, as if the forest denizens avoid this area and the bizarre plant's seductive, predatory dance.  For now, it remains at its perch, granting passage to those who are swift."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":14,"x":-40,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["Silvery dew trickles off of the dark green vines dangling from the verdant patchwork sky, forming small pools of glassy crystal that echo their muted cries of disruption at each intermittent drop."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":15,"x":-20,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A velvety carpet of flora explodes suddenly into being in this spot, bearing vibrant flowers and plants of all colors and shapes.  A sense of exuberance permeates the air here, as if it were charged with the essence of Life itself."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":16,"x":0,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A single tree lies rotting and shattered amidst a colony of its healthier brethren.  The omnipresent thorny red-tinted vines are curiously absent around it, although what is left of its bark has been scarred horribly with gouge marks."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":17,"x":0,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["The sound of water dripping in the distance echoes quietly, steadily keeping the pulse of the forest.  The rhythm is fragile yet determined, as if the slightest tilt could shatter its equilibrium and end the balance of life in this oddly beautiful place."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":18,"x":20,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["Desiccated amethyst vines hang limp off the side of a nearby tree, their delicate forms crushed and dominated by the thicker green vines armed with thorny red barbs.  The cycle of life in this habitat becomes clearer, and it is certain that all is not as it may appear."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":19,"x":40,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["Tufts of dry, scraggly witchgrass nestle at the base of a nearby tree to garner shelter and shade.  This particular tree looks rather sickly, as if stricken with something that its neighbors have not yet caught."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":20,"x":60,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["The surroundings grow dimmer, the flora itself seeming more monotone than at the entrance to this bizarre garden.  Moving into the heart of the wood, everything seems to shift from vibrant, explosive colors into chalky, dull greys."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":21,"x":80,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A soft buzzing sound emanates from a hollow beneath one of the silverwillows crowding the banks of a small stream.  Grass grows throughout, thinning and losing color as it approaches the waterline.  A narrow trail leads southerly towards a healthier region of the forest."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map134_Blighted_Tangle.xml"},
  {"id":43,"x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["The audible trickling of water beckons seductively from its unseen source.  A twisted myriad of dark vines stretch from the treetops above, blocking out all light -- whether by sun or star.  It is a wonder that anything grows on the forest's floor at all."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":44,"x":20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Edge, Adder's Coil","descriptions":["A malevolent garden borne of secrets unknown to mortals, the forest's edge is inviting to the adventurous of spirit, yet foreboding to the strong of mind.  Dark red-tinged creeper vines drape across skeletal claw-like trees, evoking the image of poisonous adders writhing in the sky above."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":45,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":45,"x":40,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Pilgrimage Trail, Vela'Tohr Valley","descriptions":["A patchwork of terraced fields bound by low rock walls spreads to the south.  Between the cultivated rows, a tidy grid work of paths is still visible forming a subtle brocade of dark earth against the less-than-verdant vegetation.  Inexplicably, the acrid tang of smoke mingled with a hint of decay lingers in the air.  The road ends here, dwindling into a weed-choked trail leading into dark forest."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":44,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map129_Pilgramage_Trail.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"Maiden's Tress","x":10,"y":-20,"z":0}
 ]
}
